VEN (banker's rounding) per FIN-212", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}]}, "name": "commit_changes", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The fix is committed. Next I'll start CI on the branch.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01JKMuzDRKa3r6Wt2HDwr8zr", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"ref": "fix/round-half-even-fin-212", "idempotency_key": "round-half-even-fin-212-08d3cd5986"}, "name": "trigger_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_018bigNWcFapqPfEAvgAngZV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"run_id": "ci-0001"}, "name": "wait_for_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "CI passed. I'll open the pull request against main and request review from alex.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01K6XwJfJ5878tf8euoPCGtD", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"head": "fix/round-half-even-fin-212", "base": "main", "title": "Fix round_money to use ROUND_HALF_EVEN (banker's rounding) per FIN-212", "body": "## Summary\n`round_money` in `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but its docstring and FIN-212 specify banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`). This caused `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even` to fail in the nightly build.\n\n## Change\n- `src/money.py`: switch `rounding=ROUND_HALF_UP` to `rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN` (and update the import).\n\n## Verification\n- CI run `ci-0001` on commit `08d3cd5986`: passed.\n- Expected values in the test check out under HALF_EVEN: 2.675 \u2192 2.68, 2.665 \u2192 2.66.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-round-half-even-fin-212-08d3cd5986"}, "name": "open_pr", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The nightly failure is fixed and PR #101 is open against main with alex requested as reviewer.\n\n- **Cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but its docstring and FIN-212 call for banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`).\n- **Fix:** On branch `fix/round-half-even-fin-212`, I changed the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` and updated the import. Under that mode the test's expected values hold: 2.675 \u2192 2.68 and 2.665 \u2192 2.66.\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` on commit `08d3cd5986` passed.\n- **PR:** [#101](https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101) targets main with alex as reviewer. I did not merge it, since merging into main needs code-owner approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}